@startuml
title Idempotency V1.1 - L0 持久状态（只保留三态）

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

state "PROCESSING\n当前存在合法执行 owner\nownerToken + version\nprocessingExpireAt" as PROCESSING
state "SUCCESS\n业务已完成\n可选 resultPayload" as SUCCESS
state "FAILED\n业务执行失败\nfailureRetryable" as FAILED

[*] --> PROCESSING : 首次原子抢占\nABSENT -> PROCESSING
PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : markSuccess\nowner + version CAS 成功
PROCESSING --> FAILED : markFailed\nowner + version CAS 成功
FAILED --> PROCESSING : recover()\n仅 recoveryMode=EXTERNAL_TASK\nversion + 1
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : recover expired PROCESSING\nnew owner + version + 1

note right of PROCESSING
PROCESSING_EXPIRED 不是数据库 status。
它是根据 processingExpireAt 计算出来的“判定状态”。
end note

note right of FAILED
FAILED_RETRYABLE / FAILED_FINAL
同样是判定状态，不新增数据库枚举。
end note

@enduml
